                        "entry_id": "e85f7f4f-95da-35a7-92b4-6791de9ef131",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Injured, or not functioning properly (with respect to legs)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "614088f6-6f41-40c2-87f8-4c4fbee119d9",
                                "sense_id": "68eb4bbf-23b8-370d-9ea7-46a6853fe462",
                                "text": "I have got a gammy leg, and can't walk far."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc901a99-29c2-4f95-801c-5cc049def533",
                                "sense_id": "68eb4bbf-23b8-370d-9ea7-46a6853fe462",
                                "text": "\"With that gammy leg I wouldn't risk a bet against the chance of another accident on those stairs.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7d21393-93cc-47c5-bf01-d789bc47f284",
                                "sense_id": "68eb4bbf-23b8-370d-9ea7-46a6853fe462",
                                "text": "In spring 2009, three years after he suffered a stroke that spared him intellectually but left him with a cane and a gammy right side, Conway delivered a six-part lecture series on his latest brainchild: The Free Will Theorem, devised with his Princeton colleague Simon Kochen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1173c7b0-7df1-4331-80bf-550aef15a90e",
                                "sense_id": "68eb4bbf-23b8-370d-9ea7-46a6853fe462",
                                "text": "I'm not exactly spectacular at the moment with a gammy knee that sometimes lets me down and hair that looks as if it's been cut with a knife and fork."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a2a976e0-f14d-381e-9ac3-29be510963d0",
                        "entry_id": "e85f7f4f-95da-35a7-92b4-6791de9ef131",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fake; counterfeit."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "33227b85-ed17-4ff1-9a6f-b1f998cbb583",
                                "sense_id": "a2a976e0-f14d-381e-9ac3-29be510963d0",
                                "text": "A little bit of real lace would be fixed on this as in process of making, and a lot of \"gammy\" stuff, imitation lace, would be carried with it."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
